build/

# Scratch modules written into the tracked src/ tree by `cargo xtask idris-check`
# (crates/xtask/src/idris_check.rs). cleanup_module() removes them on a clean run,
# but a killed/panicked run leaks them — ignore so they can never be committed.
# The matching .ttc/.ttm live under build/, already covered above.
/src/IdrisCheck*.idr
